# Build and test output.
*.test
*.out
bench.txt

# Fuzzing corpora found by the machine, not by a person. Crashers worth keeping
# are committed deliberately as regression cases under testdata/corpus.
testdata/fuzz/

# Coverage and profiling artefacts. Committing a coverage report freezes a
# number that stops being true the moment anyone writes a test.
*.out
*.html
coverage*.txt
missing*.txt

# The compiled CLI. `go install` builds it; the repository does not ship it.
/uax
